# The one place the service is named.
#
# It used to be written out in six scripts, which is how they ended up installing a unit
# called `nura-landing` long after this stopped being that project. Every script here sources
# this file, so a rename is one edit and the six cannot drift apart again.
SERVICE_NAME="ashbringer"

# What systemd shows in `systemctl status` and in the journal.
SERVICE_DESCRIPTION="AshBringer - gift card shop API"
